---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Financial Transparency — Base Impact" description="Base Impact's financial information, budget, and transparency commitment.">
  <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-body mb-4 fade-in">Financial Transparency</h1>
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-muted leading-relaxed">
    <p>Base Impact is committed to financial transparency and responsible stewardship of resources.</p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">Our commitment</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li><strong>Open books</strong> — We will publish our budget and financial statements.</li>
      <li><strong>IRS compliance</strong> — Once 501(c)(3) status is granted, we will file IRS Form 990 annually and make it publicly available.</li>
      <li><strong>Donor stewardship</strong> — Donations will be tracked and reported transparently.</li>
      <li><strong>Board oversight</strong> — Our board of directors reviews and approves all financial decisions.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">Current status</h2>
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card p-9 shadow-[var(--shadow-border)] space-y-2 text-sm">
      <p><strong>Organization type:</strong> Florida nonprofit corporation</p>
      <p><strong>501(c)(3) status:</strong> Application in progress (pre-filing)</p>
      <p><strong>Fiscal year:</strong> Calendar year (January–December)</p>
      <p><strong>Budget:</strong> Minimal — volunteer-run, pre-revenue</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">Documents</h2>
    <p>Financial documents will be published here as they become available:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
      <li>IRS Form 990 (once filed)</li>
      <li>Annual budget</li>
      <li>Financial statements</li>
      <li>Conflict of interest policy</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-sm text-faint">Documents will be added as the organization grows and completes its 501(c)(3) application.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
